    <string name="s_opcional_muestra_un_proveedor_en_la_pantalla" formatted="false">Optional: shows one provider on the Lock Screen and, if your iPhone has Dynamic Island, an icon and its percentage. Touch and hold the island to see all its quotas. Data updates only when PULSO receives a reading; the reset countdown works offline, but does not check quotas every minute in the background. Lasts up to 8 hours; iOS controls its size and may end it sooner. You must then start it again. The provider and its figures are visible without unlocking; accounts and credentials are not shown.</string>
