    <string name="s_ios_decide_cuando_ejecuta_la_solicitud_los_w" formatted="false">iOS decides when to run the request. Widgets can check Codex, Copilot and Claude while your iPhone is locked, after the first unlock following a restart. They use the encrypted Keychain shared with PULSO and keep the last reading if the request fails. Claude uses its experimental web session: if it expires or requires a check, open its session in PULSO. No refresh interval is guaranteed.</string>
