    <string name="s_google_no_admite_este_navegador_integrado_us" formatted="false">Google does not support this embedded browser. Sign in with email instead. This is not native OAuth: it keeps the current web session. When you check the quota, its session is saved in the shared encrypted Keychain to refresh widgets. Disconnecting Claude deletes that copy. You confirm codes, CAPTCHAs and any authorization yourself on claude.ai.</string>
